{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main.00_01_27_11.Still001.png?t=1744849023\" /><strong>Fart King \u2013 The Ultimate Precision Platforming Challenge!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A determined pug, a legendary crown, and only one way to reach it\u2014by mastering the power of fart propulsion! <i>Fart King</i> is a hardcore platformer where every jump is a test of skill, and every mistake sends you plummeting back down. Can you control your toots well enough to reach the top?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_1.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca8 <strong>High-Stakes Jumping!</strong><br> The only way forward is up, and gravity is your greatest enemy. One wrong move, and you'll face a long, painful fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc36 <strong>Master the Art of the Fart!</strong><br> Every jump demands precision, patience, and nerves of steel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Plan Every Jump!</strong><br> Not every path is the right one. Think before you leap, because once you're airborne, there's no turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Test of True Endurance!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deceptively simple but incredibly challenging experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete with friends to see who can claim the Fart Crown first!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive gameplay that rewards skill and persistence. <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_5.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Struggling? The Dev is Watching...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/features.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude05 Fall too often, and the developer himself might show up to roast your skills. But don\u2019t worry\u2014he\u2019s not all mean. He might just bless you with a little help: wings, a rocket, or even a teleport... if you\u2019ve truly earned his pity. Being a noob has its perks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Practice Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_8.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place checkpoints and respawn instantly to practice tough jumps.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_4.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8 Charming pixel-art visuals with smooth animations.<br> \ud83d\udd0a <strong>Choose your fart sounds!</strong> Turn on realistic, juicy fart effects for full immersion, or switch to cute 8-bit sounds if you\u2019d rather not hear toots for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve come this far\u2014will you rise to glory, or will your journey end in a humiliating fall? Only the most skilled players can become the <strong>Fart King!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE KING","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/703b5f1b3517816a7a816241f7fbda2be4d89804.jpg"},{"name":"FIRST BLIN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/b08e761058d1ff88c72fd2eefd4812534abe2f98.jpg"},{"name":"PIWO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/e00b9e39e7a84c17dc9554c43d254fd66eac32a4.jpg"},{"name":"NEW CHALLENGER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/e23f92aa7fd039f522e985048147b8654fe3e22d.jpg"},{"name":"TESTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/7023f9bfe35e66a29c6b5cca09c5743221661a30.jpg"},{"name":"SHITSTORM","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/000972600f1652dee5b0a0d3d21d2983abd2c641.jpg"},{"name":"SHITNADO","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/0b3623503c343759d9151b5d1bdee28b3f688d0e.jpg"},{"name":"52","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/f4c365b71120d6c53515e09d5a7b6cda4f2b5aa3.jpg"},{"name":"Tool-assisted speedrun","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/e3484c799f0e5b57d5354d6fcb30e0000bee6bb1.jpg"},{"name":"WORLD RECORD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3630870/a1a47af355767d3380979b5d74102b9f1d5c0f5b.jpg"}],"total":11},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630870?t=1744849023","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630870?t=1744849023","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/bcd73787f60a90e4a2f9f4228319a13c264d2f60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744849023","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/bcd73787f60a90e4a2f9f4228319a13c264d2f60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744849023","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","i