img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_5.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Struggling? The Dev is Watching...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/features.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude05 Fall too often, and the developer himself might show up to roast your skills. But don\u2019t worry\u2014he\u2019s not all mean. He might just bless you with a little help: wings, a rocket, or even a teleport... if you\u2019ve truly earned his pity. Being a noob has its perks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0 <strong>Practice Mode!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_8.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Place checkpoints and respawn instantly to practice tough jumps.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Atmosphere:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630870/extras/main_4.gif?t=1744849023\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\ud83c\udfa8 Charming pixel-art visuals with smooth animations.<br> \ud83d\udd0a <strong>Choose your fart sounds!</strong> Turn on realistic, juicy fart effects for full immersion, or switch to cute 8-bit sounds if you\u2019d rather not hear toots for hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ve come this far\u2014will you rise to glory, or will your journey end in a humiliating fall? Only the most skilled players can become the <strong>Fart King!</strong></p>","developers":["SmoochGM"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst